{
  "addedDate": "27-10-2025",
  "author": "Mallikarjun E Guggari",
  "authorImage": "https://www.w3schools.com/howto/img_avatar.png",
  "banner": "OfficialBlogBanner-1031384 (4).jpeg",
  "category": "Urban Gated Apartments",
  "categoryCount": 1,
  "contents": [
    {
      "content": "<main class=\"max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-8\">\n    <p class=\"mb-6\">\n      The Purple Line of Bangalore's Namma Metro is a vital east-west link. Running from Whitefield in the east to Challaghatta in the west (over 43&nbsp;km), it connects major hubs like MG Road, Majestic (Kempegowda), and KR Puram. This corridor is transforming daily travel by reducing commute times and easing road congestion.\n    </p>\n\n    <!-- Overview -->\n    <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold text-black mt-8 mb-3\">Overview of the Purple Line Metro Bangalore</h2>\n    \n    <figure class=\"mt-4 mb-6 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-gray-200\">\n    <img\n      src=\"https://kots-world.b-cdn.net/renting/blogs/full/purple-line-metro-map-bangalore.png\"\n      alt=\"Bangalore Namma Metro Purple Line route map from Whitefield to Challaghatta\"\n      class=\"w-full h-auto\"\n      loading=\"lazy\"\n    />\n    <figcaption class=\"px-4 py-2 text-sm text-gray-600\">\n      Purple Line route map (Whitefield ↔ Challaghatta)\n    </figcaption>\n  </figure>\n\n    <p class=\"mb-4\">\n      The Purple Line metro bangalore connects the eastern IT corridor around Whitefield/ITPL to western Bengaluru, serving key destinations including MG Road and Majestic.\n    </p>\n\n    <h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-2\">What Makes the Purple Line Important?</h3>\n    <ul class=\"list-disc pl-6 mb-6\">\n      <li>Links IT clusters (Whitefield, Baiyappanahalli) with western commercial/residential areas.</li>\n      <li>Serves thousands daily — IT professionals, students, and residents.</li>\n      <li>Interchanges with other lines (e.g., Green at Majestic; future links via Silk Board/ORR projects).</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <div class=\"overflow-x-auto mb-8\">\n      <table class=\"min-w-full text-sm border border-gray-200\">\n        <thead class=\"bg-gray-100 text-black\">\n          <tr>\n            <th class=\"p-3 text-left border\">Feature</th>\n            <th class=\"p-3 text-left border\">Detail</th>\n          </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr><td class=\"p-3 border\">Total Length</td><td class=\"p-3 border\">43.49&nbsp;km</td></tr>\n          <tr><td class=\"p-3 border\">Number of Stations</td><td class=\"p-3 border\">37</td></tr>\n          <tr><td class=\"p-3 border\">Operation Start</td><td class=\"p-3 border\">Initial sections in 2011; latest stretch operational from 2023</td></tr>\n          <tr><td class=\"p-3 border\">Major Interchanges</td><td class=\"p-3 border\">Majestic (Kempegowda), Baiyappanahalli, KR Puram, MG Road</td></tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Route -->\n    <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold text-black mt-8 mb-3\">Purple Line Metro Bangalore Route — List of Metro Stations</h2>\n    <p class=\"mb-4\">\n      The Whitefield (Kadugodi) → Challaghatta corridor spans east to west with several key stations along the way.\n    </p>\n    <h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold mb-2\">Key Stations Along the Route</h3>\n    <ul class=\"list-disc pl-6 mb-6\">\n      <li>Whitefield (Kadugodi)</li>\n      <li>KR Puram</li>\n      <li>Baiyappanahalli</li>\n      <li>Mahalakshmi Layout</li>\n      <li>MG Road</li>\n      <li>Majestic (Kempegowda)</li>\n      <li>Challaghatta</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <p class=\"mb-4\">Stations are integrated with BMTC buses, autos, and taxis for last-mile connectivity.</p>\n\n    <div class=\"overflow-x-auto mb-8\">\n      <table class=\"min-w-full text-sm border border-gray-200\">\n        <thead class=\"bg-gray-100 text-black\">\n          <tr>\n            <th class=\"p-3 text-left border\">Station Name</th>\n            <th class=\"p-3 text-left border\">Notable Nearby Locations</th>\n            <th class=\"p-3 text-left border\">Type</th>\n          </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr><td class=\"p-3 border\">Whitefield (Kadugodi)</td><td class=\"p-3 border\">ITPL, Whitefield Market</td><td class=\"p-3 border\">Elevated</td></tr>\n          <tr><td class=\"p-3 border\">KR Puram</td><td class=\"p-3 border\">KR Puram Market, Railway Station</td><td class=\"p-3 border\">Elevated</td></tr>\n          <tr><td class=\"p-3 border\">Baiyappanahalli</td><td class=\"p-3 border\">HAL (old airport area), Local Markets</td><td class=\"p-3 border\">Elevated</td></tr>\n          <tr><td class=\"p-3 border\">Mahalakshmi Layout</td><td class=\"p-3 border\">Residential Areas</td><td class=\"p-3 border\">Elevated</td></tr>\n          <tr><td class=\"p-3 border\">MG Road</td><td class=\"p-3 border\">Commercial Hub</td><td class=\"p-3 border\">Underground</td></tr>\n          <tr><td class=\"p-3 border\">Majestic (Kempegowda)</td><td class=\"p-3 border\">CBD, BMTC & KSRTC Bus Stations</td><td class=\"p-3 border\">Underground</td></tr>\n          <tr><td class=\"p-3 border\">Challaghatta</td><td class=\"p-3 border\">Mysuru Road, Southwestern Periphery</td><td class=\"p-3 border\">Elevated</td></tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Whitefield–KR Puram quick facts -->\n    <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold text-black mt-8 mb-3\">Whitefield–KR Puram Metro Line — Quick Facts</h2>\n    <div class=\"overflow-x-auto mb-8\">\n      <table class=\"min-w-full text-sm border border-gray-200\">\n        <thead class=\"bg-gray-100 text-black\">\n          <tr>\n            <th class=\"p-3 text-left border\">Fact</th>\n            <th class=\"p-3 text-left border\">Detail</th>\n          </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr><td class=\"p-3 border\">Distance</td><td class=\"p-3 border\">~13&nbsp;km</td></tr>\n          <tr><td class=\"p-3 border\">Stations</td><td class=\"p-3 border\">12 (incl. Whitefield, Hoodi, Baiyappanahalli, KR Puram)</td></tr>\n          <tr><td class=\"p-3 border\">Travel Time</td><td class=\"p-3 border\">~20 minutes</td></tr>\n          <tr><td class=\"p-3 border\">Frequency</td><td class=\"p-3 border\">Every 5–10 minutes (peak)</td></tr>\n          <tr><td class=\"p-3 border\">Key Nearby Hubs</td><td class=\"p-3 border\">ITPL, HAL area, KR Puram Railway Station</td></tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Updates -->\n    <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold text-black mt-8 mb-3\">Latest Metro Updates &amp; Expansions</h2>\n    <h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-2\">What’s New?</h3>\n    <ul class=\"list-disc pl-6 mb-4\">\n      <li>Entire corridor from Whitefield to Challaghatta is operational end-to-end.</li>\n      <li>Typical end-to-end travel time is around <span class=\"font-medium\">80–85 minutes</span>.</li>\n      <li>QR code ticketing (including WhatsApp options) for quick, contactless entry.</li>\n      <li>More train services during peak periods to improve headways.</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-2\">Upcoming Extensions</h3>\n    <p class=\"mb-6\">\n      Indicative plans include further connectivity towards growth corridors (e.g., Hoskote/Bidadi timelines discussed around 2030) and major junctions integrating with ORR projects. For official updates, refer to BMRCL/Namma Metro channels.\n    </p>\n\n    <!-- Timings -->\n    <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold text-black mt-8 mb-3\">Metro Timings and Frequency</h2>\n    <h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold mb-2\">Operating Hours</h3>\n    <ul class=\"list-disc pl-6 mb-4\">\n      <li>First train from Whitefield (Kadugodi): ~5:00&nbsp;AM</li>\n      <li>Last train from Challaghatta: ~10:45&nbsp;PM (inter-station ~11:05&nbsp;PM)</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold mb-2\">Train Frequency</h3>\n    <div class=\"overflow-x-auto mb-8\">\n      <table class=\"min-w-full text-sm border border-gray-200\">\n        <thead class=\"bg-gray-100 text-black\">\n          <tr>\n            <th class=\"p-3 text-left border\">Time Period</th>\n            <th class=\"p-3 text-left border\">Frequency</th>\n          </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr><td class=\"p-3 border\">Peak Hours (Morning & Evening)</td><td class=\"p-3 border\">3–10 minutes</td></tr>\n          <tr><td class=\"p-3 border\">Off-Peak Hours</td><td class=\"p-3 border\">10–15 minutes</td></tr>\n          <tr><td class=\"p-3 border\">Weekend Service</td><td class=\"p-3 border\">10–15 minutes</td></tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Fares -->\n    <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold text-black mt-8 mb-3\">Fare Structure and Ticketing Options</h2>\n    <h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold mb-2\">Distance-Based Fare</h3>\n    <p class=\"mb-4\">\n      Fares typically range from <span class=\"font-medium\">₹10 to ₹90</span> depending on distance. A full-length Whitefield → Challaghatta trip costs about <span class=\"font-medium\">₹90</span>.\n    </p>\n\n    <h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold mb-2\">Ticket Types</h3>\n    <div class=\"overflow-x-auto mb-8\">\n      <table class=\"min-w-full text-sm border border-gray-200\">\n        <thead class=\"bg-gray-100 text-black\">\n          <tr>\n            <th class=\"p-3 text-left border\">Ticket Type</th>\n            <th class=\"p-3 text-left border\">Fare Range (₹)</th>\n            <th class=\"p-3 text-left border\">Benefits</th>\n          </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr><td class=\"p-3 border\">Single Journey</td><td class=\"p-3 border\">10–90</td><td class=\"p-3 border\">Good for occasional travel</td></tr>\n          <tr><td class=\"p-3 border\">Smart Card</td><td class=\"p-3 border\">Distance-based</td><td class=\"p-3 border\">Saves time & money for daily commuters</td></tr>\n          <tr><td class=\"p-3 border\">QR Code (incl. WhatsApp)</td><td class=\"p-3 border\">As per distance</td><td class=\"p-3 border\">Instant, paperless, convenient</td></tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Connectivity -->\n    <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold text-black mt-8 mb-3\">Connectivity and Last-Mile Transport</h2>\n    <h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold mb-2\">Interchange Stations</h3>\n    <ul class=\"list-disc pl-6 mb-4\">\n      <li>Majestic (Kempegowda) → Green Line interchange</li>\n      <li>Baiyappanahalli → access to HAL area & feeder services</li>\n      <li>KR Puram → Rail & bus connectivity</li>\n      <li>Silk Board (future) → planned Yellow/Blue/ORR links</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold mb-2\">Local Transport Options</h3>\n    <ul class=\"list-disc pl-6 mb-6\">\n      <li>BMTC buses at most stations (e.g., Whitefield, Challaghatta).</li>\n      <li>Auto, taxi, and e-rickshaw availability at exits.</li>\n      <li>Corporate shuttles/ORRCA buses enhance last-mile for IT hubs.</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <!-- Real Estate -->\n    <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold text-black mt-8 mb-3\">Impact on Real Estate and Commuting</h2>\n    <p class=\"mb-4\">\n      The Purple Line has driven residential and commercial development around many stations. Improved access reduces commute times and stress, supporting better work-life balance.\n    </p>\n    <div class=\"overflow-x-auto mb-8\">\n      <table class=\"min-w-full text-sm border border-gray-200\">\n        <thead class=\"bg-gray-100 text-black\">\n          <tr>\n            <th class=\"p-3 text-left border\">Area</th>\n            <th class=\"p-3 text-left border\">Approx. Rental Increase %</th>\n            <th class=\"p-3 text-left border\">Metro Impact</th>\n          </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr><td class=\"p-3 border\">Whitefield</td><td class=\"p-3 border\">15–20%</td><td class=\"p-3 border\">Near Whitefield Metro Station</td></tr>\n          <tr><td class=\"p-3 border\">Mahalakshmi Layout</td><td class=\"p-3 border\">10–15%</td><td class=\"p-3 border\">Close to Mahalakshmi Layout station</td></tr>\n          <tr><td class=\"p-3 border\">MG Road Area</td><td class=\"p-3 border\">18–22%</td><td class=\"p-3 border\">Near MG Road station & commercial hubs</td></tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 mb-8\">\n      Note: If you’re specifically looking for flats for rent near metro stations, a curated list can save significant search time.\n    </p>\n\n    <!-- App -->\n    <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold text-black mt-8 mb-3\">Namma Metro Mobile Application</h2>\n    <ul class=\"list-disc pl-6 mb-4\">\n      <li><span class=\"font-medium\">Booking QR Tickets:</span> One-way/return tickets instantly.</li>\n      <li><span class=\"font-medium\">Real-time Schedules:</span> Live updates on arrivals and frequency.</li>\n      <li><span class=\"font-medium\">Route Planner:</span> Trip planning with exit maps.</li>\n      <li><span class=\"font-medium\">Smart Card Recharge:</span> Recharge directly in-app.</li>\n    </ul>\n    <p class=\"mb-8\">This makes daily transit more convenient and contactless by reducing queues.</p>\n\n    <!-- QR booking how-to -->\n    <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold text-black mt-8 mb-3\">Booking QR Tickets Through the Namma Metro App</h2>\n    <ol class=\"list-decimal pl-6 mb-6 space-y-1\">\n      <li>Download and register on the app (Android/iOS).</li>\n      <li>Select origin and destination stations.</li>\n      <li>Choose ticket type (single/return).</li>\n      <li>Pay using integrated payment options.</li>\n      <li>Receive the QR on your phone; scan at entry/exit gates.</li>\n    </ol>\n\n    <!-- Contacts -->\n    <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold text-black mt-8 mb-3\">Bangalore Metro Purple Line — Contact Details</h2>\n    <ul class=\"pl-0 mb-6\">\n      <li class=\"mb-1\"><span class=\"font-medium\">Customer Care:</span> 1800-425-12345</li>\n      <li class=\"mb-1\"><span class=\"font-medium\">Email:</span> <a href=\"mailto:travelhelp@bmrc.co.in\" class=\"text-black hover:underline\">travelhelp@bmrc.co.in</a></li>\n      <li class=\"mb-1\"><span class=\"font-medium\">Official Website:</span> <a href=\"https://english.bmrc.co.in\" class=\"text-black hover:underline\">english.bmrc.co.in</a></li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <!-- Key takeaways -->\n    <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold text-black mt-8 mb-3\">Key Takeaways</h2>\n    <ul class=\"list-disc pl-6 mb-6\">\n      <li>Whitefield ↔ Challaghatta corridor with <span class=\"font-medium\">37</span> stations over ~<span class=\"font-medium\">43&nbsp;km</span>.</li>\n      <li>End-to-end travel time ~<span class=\"font-medium\">80–85 minutes</span>.</li>\n      <li>Major stations: MG Road, Majestic, Baiyappanahalli, Mahalakshmi Layout.</li>\n      <li>Operating hours roughly <span class=\"font-medium\">5:00&nbsp;AM–11:00&nbsp;PM</span>.</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <!-- Conclusion -->\n    <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold text-black mt-8 mb-3\">Conclusion</h2>\n    <p class=\"mb-6\">\n      Spanning ~43.5&nbsp;km with 37 stations, the Purple Line connects key areas from Whitefield to Challaghatta with reliable service throughout the day. Fares range from ₹10–₹90, and integration with other lines and last-mile options makes it a practical choice for daily commuting. The Namma Metro app further streamlines ticketing via QR codes. Overall, the line reduces road traffic, shortens journeys, and positively impacts real estate near stations.\n    </p>\n\n    <!-- FAQ -->\n    <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-black mt-10 mb-4\">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n    <div class=\"space-y-3\" id=\"faq\">\n      <!-- FAQ item -->\n      <div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-lg\">\n        <button class=\"faq-toggle w-full flex items-center justify-between p-4 text-left\">\n          <span class=\"font-medium\">1) Is metro available to Challaghatta?</span>\n          <svg class=\"faq-arrow w-5 h-5 text-gray-500 transition-transform duration-300\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\"/></svg>\n        </button>\n        <div class=\"faq-content max-h-0 overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 px-4 pb-0 text-gray-600\">\n          Yes. The Purple Line runs all the way to Challaghatta.\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-lg\">\n        <button class=\"faq-toggle w-full flex items-center justify-between p-4 text-left\">\n          <span class=\"font-medium\">2) What time is the metro from Whitefield to Challaghatta?</span>\n          <svg class=\"faq-arrow w-5 h-5 text-gray-500 transition-transform duration-300\"><path stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\"/></svg>\n        </button>\n        <div class=\"faq-content max-h-0 overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 px-4 pb-0 text-gray-600\">\n          First trains start around <span class=\"font-medium\">5:00&nbsp;AM</span>; last trains operate until roughly <span class=\"font-medium\">10:45–11:05&nbsp;PM</span> depending on station.\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-lg\">\n        <button class=\"faq-toggle w-full flex items-center justify-between p-4 text-left\">\n          <span class=\"font-medium\">3) How long is the journey from Challaghatta to Whitefield?</span>\n          <svg class=\"faq-arrow w-5 h-5 text-gray-500 transition-transform duration-300\"><path stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\"/></svg>\n        </button>\n        <div class=\"faq-content max-h-0 overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 px-4 pb-0 text-gray-600\">\n          About <span class=\"font-medium\">80–85 minutes</span> end-to-end (typical ~83 minutes).\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-lg\">\n        <button class=\"faq-toggle w-full flex items-center justify-between p-4 text-left\">\n          <span class=\"font-medium\">4) Which is the last stop on the Purple Line?</span>\n          <svg class=\"faq-arrow w-5 h-5 text-gray-500 transition-transform duration-300\"><path stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\"/></svg>\n        </button>\n        <div class=\"faq-content max-h-0 overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 px-4 pb-0 text-gray-600\">\n          <span class=\"font-medium\">Challaghatta</span> is the western terminus.\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-lg\">\n        <button class=\"faq-toggle w-full flex items-center justify-between p-4 text-left\">\n          <span class=\"font-medium\">5) What is the one-way fare from Whitefield (Kadugodi) to Challaghatta?</span>\n          <svg class=\"faq-arrow w-5 h-5 text-gray-500 transition-transform duration-300\"><path stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\"/></svg>\n        </button>\n        <div class=\"faq-content max-h-0 overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 px-4 pb-0 text-gray-600\">\n          Approximately <span class=\"font-medium\">₹90</span> (distance-based).\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-lg\">\n        <button class=\"faq-toggle w-full flex items-center justify-between p-4 text-left\">\n          <span class=\"font-medium\">6) What are the starting and ending points of the Purple Line?</span>\n          <svg class=\"faq-arrow w-5 h-5 text-gray-500 transition-transform duration-300\"><path stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\"/></svg>\n        </button>\n        <div class=\"faq-content max-h-0 overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 px-4 pb-0 text-gray-600\">\n          <span class=\"font-medium\">Whitefield (Kadugodi)</span> in the east to <span class=\"font-medium\">Challaghatta</span> in the west.\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-lg\">\n        <button class=\"faq-toggle w-full flex items-center justify-between p-4 text-left\">\n          <span class=\"font-medium\">7) What metro stations serve the Whitefield tech corridor?</span>\n          <svg class=\"faq-arrow w-5 h-5 text-gray-500 transition-transform duration-300\"><path stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\"/></svg>\n        </button>\n        <div class=\"faq-content max-h-0 overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 px-4 pb-0 text-gray-600\">\n          Whitefield (Kadugodi), Hopefarm Channasandra, Kadugodi Tree Park, Pattanduru Agrahara, Sri Sathya Sai Hospital, Nallurhalli, Kundalahalli, Seetharampalya, Hoodi, Garudacharapalya.\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-lg\">\n        <button class=\"faq-toggle w-full flex items-center justify-between p-4 text-left\">\n          <span class=\"font-medium\">8) Approx. fare from Whitefield to MG Road / Majestic?</span>\n          <svg class=\"faq-arrow w-5 h-5 text-gray-500 transition-transform duration-300\"><path stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\"/></svg>\n        </button>\n        <div class=\"faq-content max-h-0 overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 px-4 pb-0 text-gray-600\">\n          Whitefield → MG Road: ~₹70; Whitefield → Majestic: ~₹80 (distance-based).\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-lg\">\n        <button class=\"faq-toggle w-full flex items-center justify-between p-4 text-left\">\n          <span class=\"font-medium\">9) Is there direct metro to Kempegowda International Airport?</span>\n          <svg class=\"faq-arrow w-5 h-5 text-gray-500 transition-transform duration-300\"><path stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\"/></svg>\n        </button>\n        <div class=\"faq-content max-h-0 overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 px-4 pb-0 text-gray-600\">\n          Not yet. Future lines (e.g., Blue/airport link) are planned to connect via KR Puram/Silk Board.\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-lg\">\n        <button class=\"faq-toggle w-full flex items-center justify-between p-4 text-left\">\n          <span class=\"font-medium\">10) Is Silk Board connected to the metro?</span>\n          <svg class=\"faq-arrow w-5 h-5 text-gray-500 transition-transform duration-300\"><path stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\"/></svg>\n        </button>\n        <div class=\"faq-content max-h-0 overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 px-4 pb-0 text-gray-600\">\n          Not currently. Connectivity is planned through upcoming projects.\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-lg\">\n        <button class=\"faq-toggle w-full flex items-center justify-between p-4 text-left\">\n          <span class=\"font-medium\">11) How many stations are there between Whitefield and Majestic?</span>\n          <svg class=\"faq-arrow w-5 h-5 text-gray-500 transition-transform duration-300\"><path stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\"/></svg>\n        </button>\n        <div class=\"faq-content max-h-0 overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 px-4 pb-0 text-gray-600\">\n          On the Purple Line segment from Whitefield to Majestic there are about <span class=\"font-medium\">23</span> stations in total.\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  <!-- FAQ accordion logic (closed by default, rotate arrow on open) -->\n  <script>\n    const toggles = document.querySelectorAll('.faq-toggle');\n    toggles.forEach(btn => {\n      btn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n        const content = btn.nextElementSibling;\n        const arrow = btn.querySelector('.faq-arrow');\n\n        // Close all others\n        document.querySelectorAll('.faq-content').forEach(el => {\n          if (el !== content) {\n            el.style.maxHeight = null;\n            el.classList.add('pb-0');\n            const ar = el.previousElementSibling.querySelector('.faq-arrow');\n            if (ar) ar.classList.remove('rotate-180');\n          }\n        });\n\n        // Toggle current\n        if (content.style.maxHeight) {\n          content.style.maxHeight = null;\n          content.classList.add('pb-0');\n          arrow.classList.remove('rotate-180');\n        } else {\n          content.style.maxHeight = content.scrollHeight + 'px';\n          content.classList.remove('pb-0');\n          arrow.classList.add('rotate-180');\n        }\n      });\n    });\n\n    // Ensure all are closed on load\n    document.querySelectorAll('.faq-content').forEach(el => {\n      el.style.maxHeight = null;\n      el.classList.add('pb-0');\n    });\n  </script>\n\n\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org/\",\n  \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n  \"mainEntity\": [\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What is the Purple Line in metro in Bangalore?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"The Purple Line Metro is part of Bangalore’s Namma Metro network, connecting key areas from the east to the west, including IT hubs and residential neighborhoods.\"\n      }\n    },\n \n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Which metro stations are in the Purple Line in Bangalore?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"The Purple Line includes major stations such as Baiyappanahalli, MG Road, Majestic, Mysore Road, Challaghatta, and Whitefield, along with several other stops along the route.\"\n      }\n    },\n \n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What is the route of Purple Line metro in Bangalore?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"The Purple Line Metro runs from Whitefield (Kadugodi) in the east to Challaghatta in the west, passing through central business districts and major residential areas.\"\n      }\n    },\n \n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Where can I find the list of Purple Line Metro stations in Bangalore?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"You can find a complete list of Purple Line Metro stations on the official BMRCL website, including all operational and upcoming stops.\"\n      }\n    },\n \n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What are the stations in Purple Line in Bangalore Metro?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"The Purple Line stops include Cubbon Park , Baiyappanahalli, MG Road, Majestic, Mysore Road, Challaghatta, Whitefield, and other intermediate stations along the route.\"\n      }\n    },\n \n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What is the Whitefield Metro line in Bangalore?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"The Whitefield Metro line is part of the Purple Line extension that connects the IT hub in Whitefield to central Bangalore, improving commute for employees and residents.\"\n      }\n    },\n \n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Where is Challaghatta Metro on the Purple Line?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Challaghatta Metro is located on the western stretch of the Purple Line, serving areas along Mysore Road and connecting to other key metro lines in Bangalore.\"\n      }\n    },\n \n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Is Majestic Purple Line metro?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"The Purple Line Metro route covers eastern and western corridors, linking Whitefield (Kadugodi) , Baiyappanahalli, MG Road, Majestic, Mysore Road, Challaghatta, , and other key areas in Bangalore.\"\n      }\n    },\n \n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Where can I see the Bangalore Purple Line Metro route map?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"The Purple Line Metro route map is available on the official BMRCL website and shows all operational and upcoming stations along the route.\"\n      }\n    },\n{\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"How many stations are along the Purple Line?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"The Purple Line of Namma Metro in Bangalore has 37 stations along its route.\"\n      }\n    },\n{\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"How many exits are there in Cubbon Park Metro Station?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Cubbon Park Metro Station has four exits—A, B, C, and D. Each exit connects the street level to the underground mezzanine, providing access to different areas around the station.\"\n      }\n    },\n{\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What time does the Metro Purple line start in Bangalore?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"The Bangalore Metro Purple Line starts at 5:00 AM on weekdays and Saturdays, and 7:00 AM on Sundays, with the last train running until 11:00 PM daily..\"\n      }\n    },\n \n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Which Purple Line Metro stations connect to Whitefield?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Stations connecting to Whitefield include Baiyappanahalli, Mahadevapura, Krishnarajapura (KR Puram), and other stops along the eastern corridor of the Purple Line.\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}</script>",
